  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCPF-Capacity Building on REDD+ for CSOs and Local Communities in EAP Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed objective of the project is to strengthen: (i) the knowledge of targeted southern civil society organizations and local communities of REDD+ Readiness at the national level; and (ii) knowledge exchange at the regional level.</narrative>
  </description>
